#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst:5
msgid "Ellipse"
msgstr "椭圆"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst:8
msgid "Create ellipse"
msgstr "创建椭圆"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst:10
msgid "The ellipse can only be added to `workspace`_ from `toolbar`_."
msgstr "椭圆只能从 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 添加到 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst:12
msgid "Select the icon |icon_ellipse| from `toolbar`_ to add an ellipse."
msgstr "从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 选择图标 |icon_ellipse| 以添加椭圆 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst:16
msgid "icon_ellipse"
msgstr "图标( L)"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst:13
msgid "Click the position from the ellipse center point in the `workspace`_."
msgstr "单击 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中椭圆中心点的位置。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst:14
msgid ""
"Click the position from the control point of the ellipse in the "
"`workspace`_."
msgstr "单击 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中椭圆控制点的位置。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst:20
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Parts**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 不显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 部件** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst:23
msgid "Ellipse properties"
msgstr "椭圆属性"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst:25
msgid ""
"Element part properties can be displayed from `information panel`_ when the "
"part is selected."
msgstr "元素部分属性可以在选择该部分时从 `信息面板 <information panel_>`_ 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst:30
msgid ""
"If the `information panel`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from "
"**Settings > Display > Information**."
msgstr "如果 `信息面板 <information panel_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 信息** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst:35
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech ellipse part from element"
msgstr "图：元素的QElectroTech椭圆部分"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst:37
msgid "QElectroTech allows customizing different ellipse properties:"
msgstr "QElectroTech 允许自定义不同的椭圆属性："

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "外观"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst
msgid "Color"
msgstr "颜色"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst:43
msgid ""
"The outline and filling color of the part can be defined from a list of pre-"
"defined colors."
msgstr "部分的轮廓和填充颜色可以从预定义的颜色列表中定义。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst
msgid "Style"
msgstr "样式"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst:48
msgid ""
"The outline representation type can be chosen between: Normal (Continuous), "
"Dashed, Dotted or, Dots and dashes."
msgstr "大纲表达式类型可以在：正常(持续), Dashed, Dotted 或，Dots 和 dustes 之间选择。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst
msgid "Thickness"
msgstr "厚度"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst:53
msgid ""
"The outline thickness (Weight) can be chosen between: None, Thin, Normal, "
"Strong or High."
msgstr "轮廓厚度(重量)可以在：无，细，正常，强或高之间选择。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst
msgid "Geometry"
msgstr "几何"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst
msgid "Coordinates"
msgstr "坐标"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst:60
msgid "The ellipse center point coordinates (x, y) can be defined."
msgstr "椭圆中心点坐标(x,y)可以定义。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst
msgid "Dimensions"
msgstr "尺寸"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_parts/ellipse.rst:64
msgid ""
"The horizontal and vertical (minimum and maximum or maximum and minimum) "
"diameters from the ellipse can be defined."
msgstr "可以定义椭圆的横向和纵向(最小和最大或最大和最小)直径。"
